---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Could This Meeting Be an Email?"
  description="Paste a meeting invite and a classifier rates it: keep the meeting, make it shorter, or this is an email. Runs entirely in your browser."
  current="home"
>
  <h1>Could this meeting be an email?</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Paste a meeting invite or agenda and a small model trained on hand-labeled invites rates it: 
    <strong>Keep the meeting</strong>, <strong>Make it shorter</strong>, or 
    <strong>This is an email</strong>, and highlights the phrases that drove the score.
  </p>
  <p class="privacy">
    <strong>Runs entirely in your browser.</strong> Nothing you paste leaves your device.
  </p>
  <p>The model is still being trained. Check back soon.</p>
</Layout>
